  "releaseNotes": "Added Truncate(), TruncateFront() and Reverse() to peSHIr.Text, and made sure more existing methods (like InitialCapital) follow as many TextOptions as they can, including now a potential MaximumLength to truncate and type of ellipsis (none, three dots, or a single Unicode character). (Still not everything is all documented and unit tested properly; this is still a work in progress, mostly for internal reuse for now. Also, the matrix code from https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/people/jammc with some extra usability wrappers still has not made the cut just yet.)",
